### Training Dataset Features

The training dataset contains demographic, anthropometric, clinical, laboratory, lifestyle, sleep-related, and health-related variables. The descriptions of the variables are provided below.

| Variable | Description |
|---|---|
| `RIDAGEYR` | Age in years |
| `RIAGENDR` | Gender |
| `RIDRETH3` | Race and Hispanic origin |
| `DMDEDUC2` | Education level |
| `INDFMPIR` | Family income-to-poverty ratio |
| `BMXWT` | Body weight (kg) |
| `BMXHT` | Standing height (cm) |
| `BMXBMI` | Body mass index (BMI) |
| `BMXWAIST` | Waist circumference (cm) |
| `BMXARMC` | Mid-upper arm circumference (cm) |
| `BPQ020` | History of hypertension |
| `BPQ080` | History of high cholesterol |
| `LBXIN` | Fasting insulin level |
| `LBDHDD` | HDL cholesterol level |
| `LBXTC` | Total cholesterol level |
| `LBXSAL` | Serum albumin level |
| `LBXSATSI` | Serum alanine aminotransferase (ALT) level |
| `LBXSASSI` | Serum aspartate aminotransferase (AST) level |
| `LBXSGTSI` | Serum gamma-glutamyl transferase (GGT) level |
| `LBXSAPSI` | Serum alkaline phosphatase level |
| `LBXSCR` | Serum creatinine level |
| `LBXBU` | Blood urea nitrogen level |
| `LBXSUA` | Serum uric acid level |
| `LBXTR` | Triglyceride level |
| `LBDLDLN` | LDL cholesterol level |
| `URDACT` | Urinary albumin-to-creatinine ratio |
| `LBXWBCSI` | White blood cell count |
| `LBXRBCSI` | Red blood cell count |
| `LBXHGB` | Hemoglobin level |
| `LBXMCVSI` | Mean corpuscular volume |
| `LBXRDW` | Red cell distribution width |
| `LBXPLTSI` | Platelet count |
| `ALQ121` | Frequency of alcohol consumption in the past 12 months |
| `PAQ605` | Vigorous work-related physical activity |
| `PAQ620` | Moderate work-related physical activity |
| `PAQ635` | Walking or bicycling for transportation |
| `PAQ650` | Vigorous recreational physical activity |
| `PAQ665` | Moderate recreational physical activity |
| `PAD680` | Daily sedentary activity time (minutes) |
| `DBQ700` | Self-reported diet quality |
| `SLD012` | Sleep duration on weekdays or workdays |
| `SLD013` | Sleep duration on weekends or non-workdays |
| `KIQ022` | History of weak or failing kidneys |
| `Diabetes` | Target variable indicating prediabetes or diabetes status |
| `SBP_MEAN` | Mean systolic blood pressure |
| `DBP_MEAN` | Mean diastolic blood pressure |
| `Smoking_Status` | Smoking status |
| `UACR` | Urinary albumin-to-creatinine ratio |

**Note:** `Diabetes` is the target variable, while the remaining variables are used as predictors. `SBP_MEAN`, `DBP_MEAN`, and `Smoking_Status` are derived variables. `URDACT` and `UACR` should be checked against the data-processing code to confirm whether they represent separate variables or duplicate measurements.
